From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Caner Altinbasak <cal@brightsign.biz>
Date: Fri, 28 Aug 2026 13:37:43 +0100
Subject: feat: BrightSign non-HWZ video on graphics OS-21753

Map the native player's shared-memory frames as media::VideoFrames and
composite them at z-index:0 (hwz:off): per-slot mmap cache, ring-slot
release via a destruction observer, sRGB tagging, and metadata bounds
validation. Retires the colour experiment and restores the overlay path
for hwz:on.

